Z||000000||Greg Piet||11-15-1999||12:58 AM||||I live in an apartment, and the fiero got me in trouble with the super!<P>I recently tuned up the little car, and it is much more peppy.  I also put in the factory subwoofer.  <P>So...  Saturday around 5 PM I left the apartment and itching to play with the car.  So the first thing was to turn on the stereo and play with the "performance sound" slider.<P>Next, I was feeling silly, so I left a pair of tire marks about five feet long.  <P>When I got home there was a note on my door, saying that such loud music and "pealing out" would not be tolerated.  Well I suppose I deserve it, but I must admit I enjoyed the wee bit of tom foolery. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||11-15-1999||10:15 AM||||BAAAAAAAAAAAAAAD Boy.   Don't you know your not supposed to have fun in your Fiero. (At least not in your own neighborhood!)||||reg||1
