Z||000003||Greg Piet||11-15-1999||03:42 PM||||Yes, I just went wild,  I talked to my roommate, who in turn talked to the super.  Well apparently it was time to "finally" say something.  I have only done this twice, so I think I am being blamed for the chevy 350 burnouts which I hear quite a bit by someone else.  <P>I think im going to have to complain about the groundskeeper mowing outside my window at 6AM, which I find much more disturbing than the stock fiero "performance" sound system at 5 PM regradless if they dont like my taste in music.||||reg||1
